title    Ride Over (win)
composer Claude (ShooterCoaster)
about    The results screen after a 2 or 3 star run (#792). A rising brass-and-bell fanfare that lands on a full C major chord with a crash, then a bright vibes loop over strings, harp arpeggios, a walking bass and a light kick and hat. The lose cut (results-lose) is its quiet sibling.
tempo    100
beats    4
steps    2
reverb   0.4

voice brass  brass    vol=0.6  center=G4
voice bell   bell     vol=0.5  pan=0.3
voice glock  glock    vol=0.22 pan=-0.35
voice timp   timpani  vol=0.6
voice crash  crash    vol=0.3  pan=0.25
voice vibes  vibes    vol=1.1  pan=-0.2
voice harp   harp     vol=0.35 pan=0.4
voice pad    strings  vol=0.42 pan=0.25 center=E4
voice bass   upright  vol=1.0  oct=1
voice kick   kick     vol=0.35
voice hat    hat      vol=0.14 pan=0.3

